s because I've gotten over 350 clicks so far, and why would someone do a key system if the script wasn't better?","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-07-29T21:18:16.691Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"68893d1a953b8041a56ebe4a","commentBy":{"_id":"685ca7dafa4ed0661a5ca5fb","username":"xdinorun","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","createdAt":"2025-06-26T01:52:26.753Z","lastActive":"2025-12-28T04:31:57.259Z","status":"offline","id":"685ca7dafa4ed0661a5ca5fb","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":5}},"text":"Hi minatoobito sorry but linkvertise only lets you do one key system per hour. I realize it's a problem, so I will switch it to work.ink soon which doesn't have that limit. (Obviously there will still only be one task because I don't want to make it too difficult). I just need a couple more days to reach the minimum payout for linkvertise since ive already made some money on there and then I can switch it over.","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-07-29T21:28:58.445Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"6889496cc8c2b1ab28e75d80","commentBy":{"_id":"685ca7dafa4ed0661a5ca5fb","username":"xdinorun","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","createdAt":"2025-06-26T01:52:26.753Z","lastActive":"2025-12-28T04:31:57.259Z","status":"offline","id":"685ca7dafa4ed0661a5ca5fb","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":5}},"text":"Oh wait Aodoxide, sorry I thought you were Astric the creator of the other script since the names are similar. Anyway my point still stands.","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-07-29T22:21:32.435Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"6889c1fcc8ef1f31dcb5f066","commentBy":{"_id":"64ec64fa4f538af76763524a","username":"xyrevex","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":"/images/photo/64ec64fa4f538af76763524a-1773045289605.png","createdAt":"2023-08-28T09:12:26.92